# On-device model weights: the canonical detector model IS committed (large, but
# it keeps a fresh clone buildable into a working offline app). Any other or
# experimental .onnx stays ignored — swap by replacing models/ffb-detector.onnx.
models/*.onnx
!models/ffb-detector.onnx

# Local Orbbec SDK release archives (the required AAR is vendored under android/app/libs/)
OrbbecSDK-Android-Wrapper-*.zip

